11
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:46,463
And a booking starts with a photo of the buyer's NRIC.

12
00:00:46,503 --> 00:00:49,431
The deal is created in seconds, with the ID masked.

13
00:00:55,146 --> 00:00:57,729
Closing Copilot — works in your pocket.

14
00:00:57,769 --> 00:01:00,016
Installable on iPhone and Android.

